    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Oates Breheny Group proudly introduce this wonderful 4/5 bedroom detached family home overlooking the scenic Sligo countryside and only moments from Sligo Town. This well appointed property is set upon circa 0.69 acres of beautifully maintained grounds, nestled behind mature trees providing privacy from the main road above. Spanning approximately 184.5 square metres in size, this spacious home is presented in great condition throughout and offers bright, airy living spaces ideal for family living. As you enter, you're greeted by a welcoming hallway that reflects the charm and character of this countryside home. The hallway leads into the various reception rooms including a cosy sitting room with open fireplace, a separate open place living/dining/kitchen area, utility room, 2 bedrooms with ensuite and walk in wardrobe to the master bedroom and main bathroom on the ground floor. Upstairs, there are 3 additional bedrooms, two with an ensuite and well proportioned attic storage space. All rooms enjoy picturesque views of the scenic landscape surroundings. The large site, offers an abundance of outdoor space surrounding the property ideal for buyers in search of generous gardens and ample outdoor space. The property features immaculately maintained gardens filled with vibrant flowers and mature shrubbery, creating a peaceful, private oasis ideal for outdoor living. The large driveway provides ample off-street parking, with easy access from the accessing main road. This property enjoys the peace of the countryside while only being a 10 minute drive from Sligo Town centre hosting a great variety of everyday essential amenities including schools, shops, bars/restaurants and also only being a short drive from the seaside village of Strandhill were you can enjoy outdoor amenities such as surfing, golfing and various scenic walk routes. Don’t miss out on the chance to own this charming home in one of Sligo’s most sought-after areas. Whether you’re looking for a place to settle down or a peaceful escape, this property provides the ideal setting. Arrange your viewing today by calling our Sales team on 0719140404."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "ACCOMMODATION\r\nGROUND FLOOR\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall\r\nCanadian Maple wood floor.\r\n\r\nSitting Room (5.13m x 4.1m)\r\nCanadian Maple wood floor. Feature open fireplace with cast iron hearth. Decorative coving to ceiling. Tv Point.\r\n\r\nLiving/Dining/Kitchen (8.7m x 3.95m)\r\nCanadian Maple wood floor to living area. Solid fuel stove. Decorative coving to ceiling. Tiled floor to kitchen and dining area. Tiled between units. Fully fitted kitchen with breakfast bar, ample units and counter space. Integrated dishwasher, electric oven, hob and extractor fan.\r\n\r\nUtility Room (2.69m x 1.94m)\r\nTiled floor and between units. Fully fitted floor and wall units. Plumbed for washing machine.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 (4.08m x 3.87m)\r\nLarge double room with carpet floor. Large window with views. Decorative coving to ceiling.\r\n\r\nWalk in wardrobe (3.02m x 2.70m)\r\nCarpet floor. Bulit in wardrobe units.\r\n\r\nEnsuite (2.87m x 1.08m)\r\nFully tiled floor to ceiling. WC & WHB. Shower (electric).\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 (2.98m x 2.74m)\r\nDouble room with carpet floor.\r\n\r\nBathroom (2.67m x 2.46m)\r\nFully tiled floor to ceiling. Bath, WC & WHB.\r\n\r\nFIRST FLOOR\r\n\r\nLanding\r\nSolid wood floor.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 (4.69m x 3.33m)\r\nDouble room with solid wood floor. Skylights. Built in shelving and wardrobes.\r\n\r\nEnsuite (2.58m x 1.33m)\r\nFully tiled floor to ceiling. WC & WHB. Shower (electric).\r\n\r\nBedroom 4/Office (4.74m x 2.24m)\r\nSingle room with solid wood floor. Built in wardrobes and units. Skylights.\r\n\r\nEnsuite (2.31m x 1.04m)\r\nFully tiled floor to ceiling. WC & WHB. Shower (electric).\r\n\r\nBedroom 5 (3.91m x 2.3m)\r\nSingle room with solid wood floor. Skylight."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Oil fired central heating\r\nDouble glazed windows\r\nCanadian Maple wood flooring to ground floor\r\nFully alarmed\r\nGenerous electrical spec\r\nLaminate facias and soffit\r\nLarge private site with ample parking & outdoor space\r\nMature surrounding gardens\r\nBeautiful scenic views\r\nShort drive to Sligo Town, Finisklin & Strandhill\r\nClose to wide range of amenities including schools, shops, sporting facilities"
      },
